WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.186
On T57, every trade moves through four stages, on one record.

2
00:00:06.386 --> 00:00:09.934
Discover. Verified suppliers send their bids.

3
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:13.965
Finance. Licensed partner banks compete to fund it.

4
00:00:14.165 --> 00:00:19.422
Execute. Contract, letter of credit, escrow and shipping, all tracked.

5
00:00:19.622 --> 00:00:22.820
Govern. One trail that both sides can check.

6
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:25.380
T57. Apply to join.
